1.  Locate the `uploadImage` function in `app/manager/menu-editor.tsx`.
2.  Replace the existing image upload logic with the code snippet above.
3.  Ensure that the `contentType` is correctly set to match the image type (e.g., 'image/jpeg', 'image/png').
4.  Test the image upload functionality again.

